# Scraper / workers

Read `.kiro/steering/analytics.md`, `docs/scraper-cloudflare-and-proxy.md`, `docs/scraping-archive/requirements.md`.

- Scraper image builds from sibling **streamclone-scraper** (`--profile scraper`). Do not raise `SCRAPER_MAX_CONCURRENT` blindly.
- Camoufox / Cloudflare / proxy issues → `make scraper-preflight`, MCP `scraper_probe`.
- Analytics workers: `backfill_jobs` table (silver/gold tiers) — see `scripts/context/backfill_status.sh` when stack is up.
- Verify scraper: `curl http://localhost:8000/health` (profile `scraper` only).

Never bypass Cloudflare observably; keep scrape debugging legitimate and logged.
